# Migration Scripts Directory

This directory contains migration scripts for contract upgrades.

## Structure

```
migrations/
├── v1_to_v2_add_reputation.rs    # Migration from v1 to v2
├── v2_to_v3_optimize_storage.rs  # Migration from v2 to v3
└── rollback_v2_to_v1.rs          # Rollback script
```

## Template

See [UPGRADE_GUIDE.md](../docs/UPGRADE_GUIDE.md#migration-framework--strategy) for full migration workflow.

### Basic Migration Template

```rust
// migrations/v{N}_to_v{N+1}_{description}.rs

use soroban_sdk::{Env, Address, Result};
use crate::migration_framework::*;

/// Migrates from version N to N+1
pub fn execute_migration(env: &Env, admin: &Address) -> Result<MigrationRecord, MigrationError> {
    // 1. Plan
    let record = plan_migration(env, admin, N, N+1, symbol_short!("description"))?;

    // 2. Dry-run
    let report = dry_run_migration(env, admin, record.id, sample_data)?;
    if !report.would_succeed {
        return Err(MigrationError::ValidationFailed);
    }

    // 3. Execute batches
    let batches = (total_records + MAX_MIGRATION_BATCH - 1) / MAX_MIGRATION_BATCH;
    for batch_idx in 0..batches {
        execute_migration_batch(
            env, admin, record.id, batch_idx, batches, batch_data
        )?;
    }

    // 4. Record completion
    record_migration_completion(env, record.id, N, N+1, total_records);

    Ok(record)
}
```
